===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Rapidash|24}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*'''Fire Mane''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Blaine's Rapidash|33}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

